#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:5
msgid "Introduce a logo on the title block"
msgstr "在图框上引入标识"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:7
msgid "Select the `cell`_ where the logo should be introduced."
msgstr "选择要引入标志的 `单元格 <cell_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:8
msgid "Go to properties and choose **Logo** at **Cell type** Combo Box."
msgstr "转到属性并选择 **Logo** 在 **Cell类型** Combo Box."

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block cell properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框单元格属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:15
msgid "Define the name of the `cell`_, if it is desired."
msgstr "如果需要，请定义 `单元格 <cell_>`_ 的名称。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:16
msgid ""
"Press the **Manage logo** button to display the logo manager PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **管理徽标** 按钮显示徽标管理器 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block logo manager PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框标识管理器 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:23
msgid ""
"Press the button **Add a logo** to display the file explorer PopUP window."
msgstr "按下按钮 **添加一个标志** 以显示文件探索器 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:24
msgid ""
"Choose the SVG or Bitmap file with the desired logo and close the logo "
"manager."
msgstr "选择带有所希望的标志的 SVG 或 Bitmap 文件并关闭标志管理器 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/logo.rst:25
msgid "Choose the logo added previously at **Logo** Combo Box."
msgstr "选择先前在 **Logo** Combo Box 上添加的标志 。"
